
"smart_sources:2026-05-05 - Challenger running to unseat Bingham County assessor in Republican primary.md": {"path":"2026-05-05 - Challenger running to unseat Bingham County assessor in Republican primary.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"11arvtl","at":1785795032679},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783542654612,"size":17750,"at":1785795032775,"hash":"11arvtl"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,27],"###Tell us about yourself — include information about your family, career, education, volunteer work, and any prior experience in public office.":[28,43],"###Tell us about yourself — include information about your family, career, education, volunteer work, and any prior experience in public office.#{1}":[30,43],"###Why are you seeking political office within your community? Briefly explain your political platform.":[44,57],"###Why are you seeking political office within your community? Briefly explain your political platform.#{1}":[46,57],"###What are the greatest challenges facing people in your county? What is your plan to meet and overcome those challenges?":[58,71],"###What are the greatest challenges facing people in your county? What is your plan to meet and overcome those challenges?#{1}":[60,71],"###How will you best represent the views of your constituents – even those with differing political views? How do partisan politics play into your role as an elected leader?":[72,87],"###How will you best represent the views of your constituents – even those with differing political views? How do partisan politics play into your role as an elected leader?#{1}":[74,87],"###What parts of the county budget could use more funding? Where are places in the budget where cuts could be made?":[88,97],"###What parts of the county budget could use more funding? Where are places in the budget where cuts could be made?#{1}":[90,97],"###What specific changes can be made in this office to increase public transparency and access to public information? How will you communicate directly with your constituents?":[98,113],"###What specific changes can be made in this office to increase public transparency and access to public information? How will you communicate directly with your constituents?#{1}":[100,113],"###Can you give a concrete example of a policy or budget decision you would support to improve a county service within your first year in office?":[114,125],"###Can you give a concrete example of a policy or budget decision you would support to improve a county service within your first year in office?#{1}":[116,125],"###What experience do you bring that prepares you to manage county finances, and how will you ensure fiscal responsibility?":[126,140],"###What experience do you bring that prepares you to manage county finances, and how will you ensure fiscal responsibility?#{1}":[128,140]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Logan Ramsey","target":"Logan Ramsey","line":5},{"title":"East Idaho Elects","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/news/east-idaho-elects/","line":10},{"title":"(left) Donovan Harrington and (right) Jonathan Stimens","target":"https://s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/assets.eastidahonews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Bingham-County-Assesor-2026.jpg","line":12,"embedded":true},{"title":"SUBMIT A CORRECTION","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/submit-a-correction/?headline=Challenger%20running%20to%20unseat%20Bingham%20County%20assessor%20in%20Republican%20primary&url=https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/05/challenger-running-to-unseat-bingham-county-assessor-in-republican-primary/","line":138},{"title":"Click here","target":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/eastidahonews-com-code-of-ethics/#onlinecommenting","line":140}],"metadata":{"title":"Challenger running to unseat Bingham County assessor in Republican primary","source":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2026/05/challenger-running-to-unseat-bingham-county-assessor-in-republican-primary/?emci=25b96940-ce48-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&emdi=a4c9a91f-4349-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&ceid=110103","author":["[[Logan Ramsey]]"],"published":"2026-05-05","created":"2026-07-08","description":"BINGHAM COUNTY – A challenger is running to unseat the incumbent assessor for Bingham County. Incumbent county assessor Donovan Harrington is seeking reelection by his constituents, who voted him into office in November 2022 after he was appointed to fill a vacancy in June 2020. Challenger Jonathan Stimens is running to replace him. Both candidates […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},